# Changes to these paths need a review from a code owner before they merge
# into main (the "main: reviews and checks" ruleset requires it).
#
# They cover everything that runs with repository credentials or decides
# what ships: workflows and their scripts, the build and package config, and
# the plugin metadata Jellyfin reads. Everything else merges on green CI.

/.github/                @mondominator
*.csproj                 @mondominator
*.props                  @mondominator
*.targets                @mondominator
*.sln                    @mondominator
*.slnx                   @mondominator
global.json              @mondominator
nuget.config             @mondominator
NuGet.Config             @mondominator
/build.yaml              @mondominator
/meta.json               @mondominator
/manifest.json           @mondominator
